<title>FRANCE: Havas Advertising Q1 sales up 17.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Havas Advertising Q1 sales up 17.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover     7.0, up 17.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Havas Advertising published its first-quarter sales in a statement. It said they rose 17.4 percent or 7.1 percent at constant structure and exchange rates.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
